# Every genre stores: lofi piece 3 with its pad level changed, saved; another genre and back brings it as saved; so does a power cycle.
seed 0
wait 3000
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
turn PRESET 2
wait 200
expect piece 2
tap ENV
spin K1 -10
wait 100
expect edited 4
expect par0 44
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 4
expect dirty 0
expect edited 0
# house and back: the stored piece, not the recipe
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 2
expect saved 0
press GLO
turn PRESET -1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
expect saved 4
expect par0 44
# a power cycle: the original genre again at power-on, lofi by the dial: still saved
reboot
wait 500
expect genre 0
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
expect saved 4
turn PRESET 2
wait 200
expect piece 2
expect par0 44
# factory on it frees the slot, and that stays
tap GLO
press SAVE
wait 1800
release SAVE
wait 600
expect saved 0
reboot
wait 500
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect saved 0
